  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.12 - Fix Production Job Monitoring\n• FIXED: Only monitor explicitly registered recurring jobs\n• FIXED: Prevent background job IDs from being treated as monitors\n• IMPROVED: Track known recurring jobs to avoid false monitoring\n• FIXED: Production issue where numeric job IDs were creating unwanted monitors\n• STABLE: Fully backward compatible\n\nv1.0.11 - Enhanced Hangfire Job ID Capture\n• IMPROVED: Enhanced RecurringJobId capture through multiple filter interfaces\n• NEW: Implements IClientFilter and IElectStateFilter for better job tracking",
